@startuml UC3_Logout
!theme plain
title UC3: Đăng xuất

actor User as "Customer/Staff/Admin"
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket

User -> Frontend: Click đăng xuất

Frontend -> Frontend: Xóa token khỏi localStorage
Frontend -> Socket: Ngắt kết nối Socket.IO
Socket --> Frontend: Disconnected

Frontend -> API: POST /api/v1/auth/logout\n(optional: blacklist token)

API -> API: Blacklist token (nếu cần)
API --> Frontend: Success

Frontend --> User: Chuyển đến trang đăng nhập
@enduml

